  "notes": {
   "linuxserver": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-sealskin/compare/0.4.0-ls2...0.4.1-ls3",
   "upstream": "# SealSkin 0.4.1\n\nMaintenance release.\n\n## Changes\n\n* **Collaboration rooms on LinuxServer.io images.** A room's viewers reach\n  the container on the session's own login again, not a view-only login of\n  their own. The view-only login broke collaboration in LinuxServer.io\n  images, and it held nothing back: every collaboration session already caps\n  each participant through its Selkies token.\n* **Kubernetes pull secrets.** The server reads a session template's pull\n  secrets on the first call, however recently the host booted.\n",
   "upstream_url": "https://github.com/selkies-project/sealskin/releases/tag/0.4.1"
  },
